<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">JASPOK.SFK 31-05-2,007 ADELINA POKOMCHI Updated for DBL by G. Grasso and E. Canales, Dec 2012, standardization after migration to PT8 by A. Camus March, 2019.</book>
  <para style="h">SANTIAGO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Stg</para>
  <para style="toc2">Stg</para>
  <para style="toc1">SANTIAGO</para>
  <para style="mt2">RE' I RUHUUJ I SANTIAGO</para>
  <para style="mt1">SANTIAGO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Taaq'anik reje suq kiil k'uxliis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hin i Santiago, raj kamanoom i Dios, raj kamanoom i QaJaaw Jesucristo. Inutaq'aaj taq rusuqkiil ak'ux i hat taq elenaq cho chupaam i kab'laj ch'uq chi tinamit Israel, i apuhkaam taq awiib' xa aha' yuuq'.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i na'ojb'al inchalik ruuk' i Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat taq nuhermano, noq neenchalik taq cha naah i xa reh reh wach chi pajarik, suuqb'oq taq ak'ux. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' taq i hat aweht'al taq chik chi re' i pajarik taq inak'ul, re' re' inye'wik taq rukowiil ak'ux chukuyariik i ti' k'axik. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' rukowiil taq ak'ux re' re' maakanaa' taq chik, reh chi neerumanaa' wach taq aweh i korik, reh wo' chi neenkowjik taq ak'ux, eh ma' xta taq neetiq'ehb'ik wii'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Wila' awach taq aweh i ko wilik iraaj i runa'ojb'al, chupahqaaj ree Dios, ruum re' Dios ma' pajooj taj noq i ruyeew chu'nchel aj eh, ruum ma' awach taj i tokoom rilariik i rub'an. <verse number="6" style="v" />Xa re' la' chu'nchel ruk'ux chupahqaaj runa'ojb'al ree Dios, ch'iklik-oq ruk'ux chi naaruye'ariik reh, ruum awach i xakiib' ruk'ux xak'ul inooj i rukapeew xa je' rukab' i rub'an i rub'ohl i palaw k'ul inooj ruum teew. <verse number="7" style="v" />Awach i xak'ul inooj i rukapeew marukapaaj chi wilik i neenye'arik reh ruum i QaJaaw Dios, <verse number="8" style="v" />ruum yu'naak tokoom i rukapaaj, eh eqal tokoom wo' chik ineerukapaaj. Chi je' re', ma' tuqlik ta wach i rukapeb'aal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' i hermano xama' nim ta tii wach i rub'an riib', chuch'ikaa' ruk'ux ruuk' i runimaal wach inye'arik reh ruum i Dios. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' i b'ehoom, chuch'ikaa' ruk'ux na' qahteesjoq i runimaal wach ruum i Dios, ruum re' i b'ehomal xa je' rukab' i rixmak'al i ch'ahn xa re' yu' insahchik wach. <verse number="11" style="v" />Noq i nelik chaloq i q'iij, inchalik i rutz'a'iil. Ruuk' i re', inchiqik i ch'ahn, inpuhlujik i rixmak'al, eh re' ruholwochiil insahchik wach. Je' wo' re' na' sahchoq wach i b'ehoom noq ko k'ahchi'-oq chusik'ariik ruman i rub'ehomal.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' pajarik eh re' q'ehb'ik pamahk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Atoob' reh awach i rukuy ransil ruuk' q'unil i pajarik, ruum noq ik'inaq chik chupaam i pajarik, naaruk'ulum i rukoróna, re' i juneliik k'acharik, i ruq'orom cho rib'iral i Dios chi naa ruye'em keh i kik'axwik reh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Awach inchalik i pajarik chinaah maa ruq'or chi re' Dios impajwik reh, ruum re' Dios ma' nee ta npajarik ruum i yiib' wach na'ojb'al, eh ma' awach ta wo' hoq neerupaj i reh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' la' rotoowjiik, eh re' ruk'axariik wach rub'aan i yiib' wach na'ojb'al i minwik reh pam pajarik i ju'jun. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh ruuk' i rotoowjiik i yiib' wach na'ojb'al, inaasjik chaloq i mahk. Eh noq ruk'amam chik raa' i mahk, kimik chik i ruk'am chaloq.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hat taq nuloq'laj hermano, majot' taq awiib' cha wib'il awiib': <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' taqe i ma' xta reet, i manlik wach i qakooch inqak'ul, pan taxaaj inchalik, re' i Dios inye'wik qeh. Re' wo' reh xyej-anik reh chu'nchel i saqum wilik cho pan taxaaj. Re' Dios ma' rujal ta wach i rukapeew, eh ma' xta ruq'equmaal wach. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' reh xchalik paruk'ux chi xuyeew qak'achariik ruum xqanimaj i korik laj k'uhb'aal, reh chi xojrukoj chi peet chuwach taqe i rutz'uhkrisam chaloq.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i xti korik laj nimanik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hat taq nuloq'laj hermano, chaweht'aliij taq i wili: Xti chayeew taq ak'ux chi ib'irinik mo'-oq teheeh taq awach chi q'orik, je' wo' chi kaqrik, <verse number="20" style="v" />ruum awach inkaqrik ma' k'ahchi' ta rub'anam imponik chuwach i Dios. <verse number="21" style="v" />Je' re' noq, chaq'eb' taq chiriij ak'ux chu'nchel i ch'uwa' wach chi b'anarik, je' wo' hoq i yiib' wach na'ojb'al, imb'aan wach ak'al. Eh chak'ulaa' taq ruuk' chaq'lamiil i ruq'or i k'uhb'aal ye'ooj taq panawánima, re' inko'linik taq aweh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Xa re' la', cha a'n wo' taq i ruq'or i ruk'uhb'aal i Dios. Mo'-oq xa hat taq aj ib'iroom, ruum wi xa xik'ik taq rij axikin, xak'ahchi' taq ajot'om awiib' cha wib'il awiib'. <verse number="23" style="v" />Awach i xa rib'iraj i k'uhb'aal eh ma' rub'an taj i ruq'or, re' re' xa je' rukab' jino'q i rilow i wach pan lemow. <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' reh xa kore' wo' naq i rilow riib' pan lemow, eh noq inooj, jumehq'iil insahchik paruk'ux nik' wach inka'yik. <verse number="25" style="v" />Raaj awach i ma' nsahchik ta paruk'ux i rib'iraj, i rukoj la' rehtaal chi manlik i korik laj k'uhb'aal, re' ineesanik cho qeh pamahk, eh i rub'an i ruq'or i k'uhb'aal, re' reh insuuqb'ik ruk'ux ruuk' taqe i rub'an.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Awach i rukoj riib' chi aj nimaneel, eh mo'-oq i ruq'il riib' ruuk' ju' raaq', re' reh xak'ahchi' rujot'om riib', eh re' nimanik i rub'an xama' xta k'isinoq inokik wii'. <verse number="27" style="v" />Re' i xti korik laj nimanik i ma' xta ruch'uwa'iil wach chuwach i Ajaab'ees Dios re' wili: Kitoob'jiik i wilkeeb' panti' k'axik, chi je' ma' xta kituut kajaaw, chi je' ixoq kamnaq kib'ahiil, eh re' chi ma' nee ta inch'uwa'resjik iib' ruuk' i yiib' wach na'ojb'al imb'aan wach ak'al.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Ma' awach taj i tokoom rilariik neenb'aan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hat taq nuhermano, i tinimanik taq reh i loq'laj QaJaaw Jesucristo, ma' ruk'ul ta chi jinaj i suq rilariik taq neena a'n, eh re' jinaj tokoom rilariik taq neena a'n. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh noq amolom taq awiib', eh nee kiokik i koq kiib'-oq i winaq taq chaxilak. Re' jinaj b'ehoom wilik taqe rulopq'aaq' oro ju' taq q'ab', eh xa holohik chik i ruso'. Eh re' jinaj xa neb'aa'-oq tii xa q'aah-oq ruso'. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh wila' xa re' b'ehoom xak'ul taq cho chi korik nee taq inaq'or reh chi je' wili: Jaaw, ti tzuun ayu' pan holohik tzunaab', tiko'q taq reh, eh re' neb'aa' nee taq inaq'or reh chi je' wili: Re' hat, tipaa' reje wulu', oon ti tzuun ayu' wach ak'al, tiko'q taq reh, <verse number="4" style="v" />chi je' re', wilik i tokoom rilariik taq i na a'n chaxilak. Iraaj ruq'orom chi k'ahchi' taq aq'atam q'orik cha naah ruuk' taq aama' holohik ta laj na'ojb'al.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hat taq nuloq'laj hermano, chab'iraj taq i naa nuq'orom aweh: Re' Dios xsik'wik cho kiwach taqe neb'aa' ayu' wach ak'al, reh chi naakib'ehomriik ruuk' i kinimaniik reh i ruk'ulariik chi kikooch i runimaal rajaawriik i Dios i ruq'orom cho rib'iral chi naa ruye'em keh i kik'axwik reh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Raaj taq i hat inak'uhtaaj taq kik'ixb'ilaal taqe neb'aa' Eh ¿awach kiq'uchwik taq i chib'ih aweh? Eh ¿awach kiqerinik taq reje aweh chikiwach i q'atal q'orik? ¿Mi ma' re' taqe re' i b'ehoom? <verse number="7" style="v" />¿Mi ma' re' wo' re' keh i kib'ajwik reh i loq'laj rub'ihnaal i Jesucristo, re' i b'ihnaal xq'orarik taq cha naah?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' taq i hat wila' xti korik chi k'ahchi' taq animam i ruq'or i k'uhb'aal nim rajaawriik tz'ihb'amaj cho pan santo laj huuj chi je' wili: Chak'ax aawas achaaq' je' rukab' noq inak'ax awiib' i hat, inki. <verse number="9" style="v" />Raaj wila' xa jinaj i suq rilariik taq i na a'n, eh re' jinaj tokoom rilariik taq i na a'n, k'ahchi' taq akojom amahk, eh ti mahkunik wo' taq chuwach i ruk'uhb'aal i Dios. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh wila' wilik i ruq'or chi runimaj chu'nchel i k'uhb'aal, eh wilik-oq jino'q reh i k'uhb'aal ma' runimaj taj, k'ahchi' rumahkuniik chuwach chu'nchel i k'uhb'aal. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' Dios xq'orik reh chi je' wili: Maach'uwa'risaj wach aakaxáro, inki. Eh xuq'or wo' chi je' wili: Maacansaj aawas achaaq', inki. Atoob' ta ma' rub'an i k'oyomal jino'q, eh i rukansaj-oq i ras ruchaaq', re' re' xama' k'ahchi' ta wo' runimam chu'nchel i k'uhb'aal. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' taq i hat parub'ehel taq tiq'oroq, eh re' taq i holohik cha a'n je'-oq taq akab' i naaruq'atariik i q'orik chikinaah ruum i ak' k'uhb'aal, ineesanik cho qeh pamahk, <verse number="13" style="v" />ruum re' taqe i ma' inkiketelaaj ta wach i tokoom, ma' naa ta wo' ruketeljiik kiwach i keh na' q'ataroq i q'orik chikinaah. Eh re' taqe i wilik ketelinik wachiis kuuk', naakeliik korik na' b'anroq i q'ataj q'orik.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' nimanik eh re' rub'anariik otob'il</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hat taq nuhermano, ¿chib'ih neerutiq reh jino'q chi neeruq'or chi ruyeew ruk'ux chunimjiik i Dios, eh mo'-oq awach i rub'an otob'il reh? ¿Mi nee inko'ljik re' chi xa re' i nimanik i rub'an? <verse number="15" style="v" />Qaq'or chi wilik jino'q i qahermano winaq oon qahermana ixoq ma' xta-oq tii ruso', eh ma' xta-oq wo' ruwa' ruhaa' neerik'saj wii' q'iij. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh wilik-oq taq jino'q aweh i hat nee ruq'or reh chi je' wili: Chawil awiib' chakoj aso' cha a'n awa' ahaa' chi korik inko'q reh, ¿raaj mo'q i ruyeew reh i ajwaal wach chi reh, chib'ih neerutiq reh i nee ruq'or chi je' re'? <verse number="17" style="v" />Je' wo' re' i runimjiik i Dios wila' xa rutkeel i nimanik imb'aan chi ma' ruch'ihil taj otob'il inkahnik chi kamnaq.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Awach oon nee nq'orik reh chi je' wili: Re' hat xa re' nimanik i na a'n, eh re' hin xa re' otob'il i nub'an, inko'q. Chak'uhtaaj aj weh re' i hat xa rutkeel i nimanik i na a'n, eh re' hin neenuk'uhtaaj aweh nik' wach i nimanik i nub'an ruch'ihil i rub'anariik i otob'il. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' hat inanimaj chi xa jinaj i Dios ma' xta reet i na a'n. Je' wo' taqe raj kamanoom i aj Yahm inkinimaj wo' keh chi xa jinaj i Dios, xa re' la' kib'arb'otik ruum kiyo'jiik. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' hat i ma' xta na'ojb'al, chanab'eej chi re' i nimanik imb'aan chi rutkeel chi ma' re' ta haa' otob'il, xama' xta kamaj inkahnik wii'. <verse number="21" style="v" />Chakoj rehtaal chi re' Dios xuq'or chi korik wach ruk'ux i Abraham, ruuk' i xub'an noq xuq'asaj naq chi mayiij wach artaal i rak'uun, Isaac rub'ihnaal. <verse number="22" style="v" />Chawil i xuk'ul i Abraham: Ruuk' i xub'an re' re', xk'utinik chi ruchopom ruk'ux chi nimanik. Eh ruuk' taqe xub'an re' re', xmanlojik wach i runimaniik. <verse number="23" style="v" />Je' re' noq xooj eloq wach i tz'ihb'amaj cho pan santo laj huuj, i chi je' wili: Re' Abraham xunimaj i Dios, eh ruuk' i xub'an re' re', xq'orarik chi korik wach ruk'ux ruum i Dios, eh xkojarik chi ramigo i Dios, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' taq i hat xakoj taq chik rehtaal chi re' Dios i ruq'or chi korik wach ruk'ux awach imb'anik reh otob'il ma' xata ruuk' i nimanik i rureq rukorkiil wach ruk'ux. <verse number="25" style="v" />Je' wo' re' xub'an i Rahab, re' i k'oyoom laj ixoq: Re' reh xuyeew kipatal taqe i aj Israel xi ponik chi taqarik, eh xutoob'eej taqe chi xi elik reje pantokoom b'eeh. Eh ruuk' i otob'il xub'an re' re', xq'orarik chi korik wach ruk'ux ruum i Dios. <verse number="26" style="v" />Re' ti'jolal noq ma' xtaj i uxlab'al ruuk', kamnaq inkahnik wii'. Je' wo' re' i nimanik imb'aan xa chi rutkeel wila' ma' ruch'ihil otob'il, inkahnik chi kamnaq.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i ruq'or i raaq' i ju'jun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hat taq nuhermano, ma' ruk'ul ta chi wilik k'ih-oq i aj Tijineel neenkian kiib' taq chaxilak, ruum aweht'al taq chik chi re' hoj i qohb'anik tijinik, kow naaruq'atariik i q'orik chi qanaah. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hoj chiquncheel xa reh reh wach qoh q'ehb'ik wii'. Raaj wila' wilik jino'q i ma' nq'ehb'ik ta ruuk' i ruq'oral, re' re' korik wach ruk'ux, eh neerub'an ruq'ilariik chu'nchel i ruti'jolal. <verse number="3" style="v" />Noq inqakoj i ch'ihch' pan kichii' taqe kawáyu reh chi nee qoh kinimaj, ruuk' i re' nee inqa a'n rub'ehteesjiik chu'nchel i kiti'jolal. <figure style="fig" desc="" file="LB00035" size="COL" loc="" copy="" ref="(3.3)">Re' kawayo ink'amarik rub'eeh ruuk' i b'ak'b'al reh i ju'.</figure> <verse number="4" style="v" />Chakoj taq rehtaal taqe barko: Atoob' ta yohb'aal wach kininqaal kiqerjik reje ruum i kowlaj teew, re' taqe kib'esanik reh xa ruuk' i jinaj k'isa b'ehtesb'al reh inkik'am reje aha' inkaaj i keh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Je' wo' re' i ju' qaaq' qohq'orik wii' re' ruuk' i qati'jolal, atoob' ta q'e' k'isiin, xa q'e' niik' naah i ruq'or. Je' rukab' i rub'an i ruk'oxb' q'aaq' xa re' yu' ruk'atam runimaal-oq i rax chee', <verse number="6" style="v" />re' ju' qaaq' je' naa nujinaq chi q'aaq', yohb'aal wach i sachooj i rub'an, nujinaq chi mahk. Re' qaaq' re' wo' ruuk' i qati'jolal, re' injot'wik reh chu'nchel i na'ojb'al. Je' qoplik ruq'aq'al ruum i ruq'aq'al i tojb'al mahk, eh je' wo' naarukoj ruq'aq'al paam chu'nchel i qak'achariik. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' winaq neerub'an ruloch'ariik kinaah taqe i josq'laj chikop, taqe i kirupinik pan taxaaj, taqe i aaq', taqe i ruchopkaal palaw xti korik chi ruloch'om cho kinaah. <verse number="8" style="v" />Raaj i ju' qaaq' reh, ma' jino'q neenloch'wik naah ruuk' taqe i yiib' wach i ruq'or. Eh nujinaq chi q'orik re' ruuk' taqe inkasanik. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh ruuk' wo' naq i ju' qaaq' inqaloq'ej i Ajaab'ees Dios. Eh ruuk' wo' chik i re' inqab'aj taqe qas qachaaq', re' taqe i ruyejaam chaloq i Dios chi je' ruwii'. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh pan qachii' i nelik chaloq i holohik laj q'orik, eh ar wo' chik i nelik chaloq i yiib' wach q'orik. Hat taq nuhermano, re' re' ma' ruk'ul ta chi b'anarik <verse number="11" style="v" />Chakoj taq rehtaal chi chupaam jino'q i raasb'al ha' ma' nee ta rub'an chi nee nelik chaloq i ki'laj ha', eh nee ta wo' chik i nelik cho ar i k'ahlaj ha'. <verse number="12" style="v" />Je' wo' re', i ruche'el i higo ma' nee ta ruwachuj i aseituna. Eh re' ruche'el i uuva ma' nee ta wo' ruwachuj i higo. Hat taq nuhermano, je' wo' re' i raasb'al i ha' k'aah ratz'amil ma' nee ta wo' inenelik cho ar i ki'laj ha'.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i xti korik laj na'ojb'al</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Wila' awach taq aweh i wilik runa'ojb'al, eh i rureq chiriij i korik, inchol ruk'uhtaam ruuk' i holohik chi b'anarik, ruuk' i chaq'lamiil inye'arik reh ruum i runa'ojb'al. <verse number="14" style="v" />Raaj mi xa re' i kaqwachiil, xa re' i wolinik iib' wilik taq panawánima, eh wilik-oq inawaaj chiriij i taq i na a'n, inanimb'isaj-oq taq awiib'. Ruuk' taqe re' k'ahchi' taq achukum i q'orik chiriij i korik, <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' na'ojb'al re' re', ma' re' taj i Dios inye'wik cho reh xa na'ojb'al la' ayu' wach ak'al, xa rukapeew winaq, eh ruuk' i aj Yahm inchalik. <verse number="16" style="v" />Aha' wilik wii' i kaqwachinik iib', eh wilik inajawjik chiriij i chib'ih imb'aan, ar wilik i tukinik wachiis, je' wo' i xa reh reh wach chi mahk imb'aan. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i wilik kuuk' i na'ojb'al inchalik ruuk' i Dios, saq chik wach i kik'achariik. Eh xasuq kik'ux chu'nchel aj uuk', ch'ub'ik wach kik'ux, xa chaq'laam taqe. Aj keteloom wachiis taqe, eh inki a'n otob'il ma' awach taj i tokoom rilariik inki a'n eh korik kiq'orik. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh awach taqe inkichop kik'ux chusik'ariik i suq kiil k'uxliis, re' wo' rusuqkiil k'uxliis inkitik, ruuk' i re', naa kireqem i korik laj k'acharik.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' rub'anariik i yiib' wach na'ojb'al imb'aan wach ak'al</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />¿Aha' inchalik i q'aq'inik, ixowanik iib' i na a'n taq chawach? ¿Mi ma' ruuk' re' i ruk'axariik wach i yiib' wach na'ojb'al, xamin min taq panawánima inchalik? <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' taq i hat inak'ax taq wach i xa chib'ih jariik, noq ma' nawehchaaj ta taq, inatoq'aa' taq kaansanik, ti kaqwachinik taq. Eh noq ma' nareq ta taq parukorkiil chib'ih taq inawaaj inatoq'aa' taq pleto. Xanaah re' xama' nareq ta wo' taq ruum ma' napahqaaj ta taq ree Dios. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh noq inapahqaaj taq aha' wilik taq inawaaj, ma' nak'ul ta taq, ruum ma' re' ta rupahqaljiik taq i na a'n. Eh re' taq inak'ax wach re' re' xa reh rub'anariik i re' ma' re' taq inawaaj wii'. <verse number="4" style="v" />Hat taq tinamit i ma' korik ta taq wach ak'ux ¿Mi ma' aweht'al taq re' hat chi re' i rub'aan i yiib' wach na'ojb'al wach ak'al rixowjiik wach i Dios i ruk'am chaloq? ¿Awach i ruk'ax wach rub'aan i yiib' wach na'ojb'al ayu' wach ak'al insutinik chi aj ixowan wach i Dios? <verse number="5" style="v" />oon inakapaaj taq i hat chi xama' xta rutiq i ruq'or pan santo laj huuj chi je' wili: Re' Santolaj Uxlab'al, i ruye'em pan qánima i Dios, q'e' qohruk'ax, eh qoh ruq'il. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' Dios reh q'e' qohrutoob'eej ruum aj re', i ruq'or chi je' wili pan santo laj huuj: Re' Dios ma' imponik ta chuwach i ja'lik kichii' kiwach. Eh re' taqe i ma' nimaq ta kiwach, i ruyeew i rotob'il chikinaah, inki. <verse number="7" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' taq i hat, chaq'asaj taq awiib' reh i Dios. Chaq'at taq wach i aj Yahm reh chi ma' nee ta rujil i koq riib' taq awuuk'. <verse number="8" style="v" />Chajil taq i koq awiib' ruuk' i Dios re' reh nee taq inwihik awuuk'. Eh re' taq i hat aj mahk, cha kanaa' taq rub'aan i yiib' wach na'ojb'al. Je' wo' taq i hat i junk'axariik i Dios taq inawaaj a'nam ruuk' i ruk'axariik wach i yiib' wach na'ojb'al chasaqb'isaj taq wach awánima. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ponoq taq ruti'kiil panak'ux taq amahk, tioq'oq taq chiriij. Re' taq ase'eel, cha sutej taq chi oq'ik, re' rusuqkiil taq ak'ux, cha sutej taq chi ruti'kiil ak'ux <verse number="10" style="v" />Chaloch' taq awiib' chuwach i QaJaaw, eh re' reh nee ruyeew taq runimaal awach.</para>
  <para style="s">Maaq'at taq q'orik chinaah aahermano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' taq i hat hermano, maach'olej taq awiib'. Awach i ruch'olej i ruhermano, eh i ruq'at q'orik chinaah, k'ahchi' wo' ruch'olem i ruk'uhb'aal i Dios, eh i ruq'at i q'orik chinaah. Eh awach i ruq'at i q'orik chinaah i k'uhb'aal, aj q'atal q'orik chik chinaah i k'uhb'aal, ruum ma' re' ta chik runimjiik i rub'an. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' xye'wik cho reh i k'uhb'aal xa jinaj, re' wo' reh i Q'atal Q'orik. Re' wo' reh inko'linik, eh inye'wik pantojb'al mahk. Eh raaj i hat, ¿chib'ih a'nam noq inaq'at i q'orik chinaah aawas achaaq'?</para>
  <para style="s">Maach'ikaa' taq ak'ux ruuk' i q'iij i iqal kab'iij</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Yu'naak chab'iraj taq i naa nuq'orom aweh i hat, i ti q'orik taq reh chi je' wili: Yu'naak i iqal kab'iij qoh-ooj panimaq tinamit, ar naa qawihiik jino'q haab', naa qa'nam qayak, reh chi neen wihik qatumiin, tiki taq. <verse number="14" style="v" />Xanaah re', ma' aweht'al ta taq chib'ih jariik taq i naa ak'ulum i iqal kab'iij. Re' taq aak'achariik xa re' yu' neensahchik wach xa je' rukab' i rub'an i suutz' noq i ruk'uhtaaj cho riib' junk'aam-oq, eh xa chi jumehq'iil wo' chik insahchik wach. <verse number="15" style="v" />Je' la' wili inchol taq aq'orom: Wila' xraaj i QaJaaw chi ko k'achalkooj, neen qa a'n i wili, eh xa chib'ih chik jariik neen qa a'n, tiko'q taq. <verse number="16" style="v" />Raaj taq i hat, q'e' taq inanimb'isaj awach chi rik'teesjiik naah i q'orik. Chu'nchel i niimb'isanik wachiis ma' toob' ta chi b'anarik <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh awach i reht'al i holohik, eh ma' rub'an taj, ru mahk i rukoj.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i naakik'ulum i kaq b'ehoom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' taq i hat kaq b'ehoom, chab'iraj taq: Tioq'oq taq, eh ponoq taq ruti'kiil panak'ux i ti' k'axik naa ruchaliik taq cha naah <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' taq ab'ehomal q'ahinaq chik, eh re' taq aholohaq so' xmoohrik chik ruum i ruchopkaal. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' taq aa oro aa plata xq'uuxrik chik kiwach. Re' ruq'uxil ink'uhtanik reh chi wilik taq amahk, eh naa taq rusacham awach je' rukab' i rub'an i q'aaq' ruum amolom taq wach ab'ehomal chupaam taqe i tz'apaab' wach ree q'iij wili. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' taqe i xi kamanik taq pan awab'iix, re' i ma' xatoj ta taqe, k'ahchi' keeb' johtoq chi k'ooq taq chawiij. Eh re' QaJaaw Dios nim rajaawriik xrib'iraj chik chaloq i k'ooq k'ahchi' keeb' taqe kamanoom re' re'. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ayu' wach ak'al xach'ikaa' taq ak'ux, xayeew taq reh ati'jolal i xak'ax taq wach. Eh xaq'inab'isaj taq awiib' je' rukab' noq inq'inab'ik i wakax noq inkanteesjik, je' re' taq i naa ak'ulum i hat. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' taq i hat kaq b'ehoom, xayeew taq panti' k'axik taqe i ma' xta kimahk, eh xakansaj taqe. Eh re' keh xa xkikuy wo' hoq i xa a'n taq keh.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' kuyuuj eh re' tiij</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ruum aj re' hermano, xa hat-oq taq kuyuul korehtaal i ruk'uliik ruka'peech i QaJaaw Jesucristo. Chakoj taq rehtaal i rub'an i aj ab'ixoom: Re' reh i rukuy ruyub'jiik i jab', kora'j i rub'an re' iiwik. Eh i rukuy wo' ruyub'jiik i ruq'ijil i rumolariik i ru holohik laj wach i rutik. <verse number="8" style="v" />Je' wo' re' taq i cha a'n i hat: Xa hat-oq taq kuyuul, maayoj taq ak'ux, ruum xanik' ma' nk'ulik chaloq ruka'peech i QaJaaw Jesucristo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' taq i hat hermano, maakoj taq amahk chawach, reh chi ma' nee ta nq'atarik q'orik taq cha naah, ruum re' Dios, i Q'atal Q'orik, ach k'isiin ma' nk'ulik. <verse number="10" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' taq i hat nuloq'laj hermano, cha tijej taq aweh nik' wach rukuyariik i ti' k'axik xkian chaloq taqe jalal ruq'oral i QaJaaw Dios, i xiq'orik chaloq parub'ihnaal. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' hoj inqaq'or chi atoob' keh inkikuy ransil i ti' k'axik. Re' taq i hat ab'iram wo' taq rib'iral i kuyuuj xub'an chaloq i Job noq xuk'ul chaloq taqe ti' k'axik. Eh aweht'al wo' taq i ruk'axariik i Job xb'aan cho koq'uun ruum i QaJaaw Dios, aj keteloom wachiis, atoob' wach ruk'ux.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hat taq nuhermano, re' hin nuq'or taq aweh, chi maaq'or taq ti wili QaJaaw, ti wili taxaaj, ti wili wach ak'al, ni xata jino'q chik tokoom b'ihnaal naa taq aq'orom. Noq naa taq aq'orom i korik, korik, tiko'q taq, noq naa taq aq'orom i ma' korik taj, ma' korik taj, tiko'q taq, reh chi ma' nee ta taq tuyeew pantojb'al mahk i Dios.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' rub'aan i tiij</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Wila' awach taq aweh i ti' ruk'ux, inchol rub'anam rutiij. Eh wila' awach taq aweh i suq ruk'ux, inchol rub'anam rutz'uuy loq'oomb'al ree Dios. <verse number="14" style="v" />Wilik oon i yowaab' taq chaxilak, inchol rutaq'aam kik'amariik taqe i kitowik i parukamaj i Dios, reh chi neenkian kitiij chinaah eh neenkib'uch' pan aseite parub'ihnaal i QaJaaw Jesucristo. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh noq neenkian kitiij chu'nchel kik'ux, re' yowaab' neenk'aachjik eh re' QaJaaw neenuksanik reh. Eh wila' wilik taqe i mahk rub'anam, neenkuyarik i ru mahk ruum i QaJaaw. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ruum aj re', k'ul taq cha pahqaaj kuyb'al amahk chawach. Eh k'ul taq cha a'n atiij chawiij, reh chinee taq tik'aachjik ruuk' ayab'ilaal. Re' rutiij i korik wach ruk'ux xti nk'utinik wach i rub'an. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' Elías, i wihinaq chaloq chi jalal ruq'oral i Dios, xa winaq wo' hoq je' rukab' i hoj. Eh noq xupahqaaj reh i Dios parutiij chu'nchel ruk'ux chi marub'an chik i jab', ma' xub'an ta wo' i jab' chuwach ixib' haab' ruuk' waqiib' poh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh noq xupahqaaj wo' chik parutiij chi chub'an wo' chik i jab', xub'an wo' chik i jab'. Eh xiwachinik wo' chik taqe i tik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hat taq nuhermano, wila' wilik taq jino'q chaxilak i xukanaa' runimjiik i korik eh tokoom-oq chik neenkojwik cho runa'ojb'al chinee wo' chik insutinik chaloq. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh chanab'eej taq chi re' inkojwik cho runa'ojb'al i aj mahk, reh chinee i rukanaa' chaloq i yiib' wach na'ojb'al, neeruko'leej chuwach i kimik, eh nee wo' ruyeew q'ab' chi neenkuyarik i ruk'ihaal ru mahk ruum i Dios.</para>
</usx>